    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hosea amo n’omokuungu otarenge omwegenwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene aganteebia, “Genda omwanche naende omokungu oyio nonya ogokora obotomani nomwanchi oye, omwanche buna Omonene anchete Abaisraeli, nonya baonchokeire chinyasae ching’ao, naende babeire n’okogania kwa amasabibu amomo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo nkamogora chisekeli chi’echifeta ikomi na isano, na esairi ebitonga ikomi na bitano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkamoteebia: “Ogenderere komenya nainche amatuko amange kore omweriti ase engencho yane. Tobaisa gokora obonyaka, gose koba oyo bw’omosaacha onde omoao, na inche ningenderere kwerita ase engencho yao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo Abaisraeli baragenderere komenya ase amatuko amange batabwati omorwoti gose omogambi, batari korua ebing’wanso, gose gosasiima amagena atenenirie, gose koba negesibao ki’obokuani, gose ebinyasae bibekire ase chinyomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma y’ayio Abaisraeli nabairane, barigie Omonene, Nyasae obo, na oyo bw’ororeria rwa Daudi, omorwoti obo; mbamoiroke Omonene, na gosemeria obuya bwaye ase amatuko y’omoerio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
